AI-Suggested Content:
The AI generated the following 10 user stories for CareerConnect:
1. Create an account
2. Log in
3. Manage my profile
4. Upload a resume
5. Search for jobs
6. Filter job listings
7. Apply for a job
8. Track application status
9. Save jobs
10. Receive application reminders

Validation:
Each User story covers the basic features of Career Connect and cover basic functionalities that a user will need. 

Decision: Accepted
The entire team reviewed each user generated stories and agreed that they were good for the project.

Reflection: AI was a useful in this instance as it acts as a user itself and aligns with our requirements for this project.
